  "sentences": {
    "s01": {
      "id": "s01",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s01.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 7.497,
      "files": {
        "v3-s01.opus": "f414f83899f04d495650cc9fe381cb15ec042758c8d1580e9ca741cb540ccf02",
        "v3-s01.mp3": "06843e8664a52e648df516725d9365150f8fb223a3cbf18e56d23a7235e3504a"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s01-01",
          "text": "Comparisons were drawn between the development of television in the 20th century ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.847
        },
        {
          "id": "s01-02",
          "text": "and the diffusion of printing in the 15th and 16th centuries.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 3.847,
          "end": 7.497
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s02": {
      "id": "s02",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s02.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 1.612,
      "files": {
        "v3-s02.opus": "5ee115358e9b05548cd92ff5dd93fb3052ca02d6f704cb1f1efe5ae3b0d1b97b",
        "v3-s02.mp3": "5f1cda2433b01f6c1186481ef47e0cb1e483843f1f83d94dea652ef510cfaf61"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s02-01",
          "text": "Yet much had happened between.",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.612
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "serious",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s03": {
      "id": "s03",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s03.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 11.242,
      "files": {
        "v3-s03.opus": "d92527e5e513d6a391ec698ccfd534cd5925a3dbbc17b59e0d9b6ffc971b9b65",
        "v3-s03.mp3": "66f280c001793bc98aed43a786ab5c0197c19fd798d1aaad58901cd44c24ce2e"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s03-01",
          "text": "As was discussed before, it was not until the 19th century that the newspaper became the dominant pre-electronic medium, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.0
        },
        {
          "id": "s03-02",
          "text": "following in the wake of the pamphlet and the book and in the company of the periodical.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 7.0,
          "end": 11.242
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s04": {
      "id": "s04",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s04.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 13.062,
      "files": {
        "v3-s04.opus": "304f1bf142eb110a3947f4e381e6b456784d29e4f6402157741f723f3e804f12",
        "v3-s04.mp3": "8043d925ef7d65b58a64131094c8d421c4c4ee5c82d35d7dbd3979cf1b6f61aa"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s04-01",
          "text": "It was during the same time that the communications revolution speeded up, ",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.564
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-02",
          "text": "beginning with transport, the railway, and leading on through the telegraph, the telephone, radio, and motion pictures ",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 3.564,
          "end": 9.992
        },
        {
          "id": "s04-03",
          "text": "into the 20th-century world of the motor car and the air plane.",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 9.992,
          "end": 13.062
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "lively",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s05": {
      "id": "s05",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s05.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 2.619,
      "files": {
        "v3-s05.opus": "5989526ca69939682f42bfd1fade4e02ba09d8d7c7c5b4132df9a9661616dc4b",
        "v3-s05.mp3": "8398ce8927a5397b0623ffec6a0934eb452c4b1d16de6962a69c96b2c85ebfa2"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s05-01",
          "text": "Not everyone sees that process in perspective.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.619
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s06": {
      "id": "s06",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s06.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s06.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 1.762,
      "files": {
        "v3-s06.opus": "5ff1f721a7ed876cbd7243615f9f3ed58b0ccd9532d88395942371ccc28a2605",
        "v3-s06.mp3": "57d0829d8ba3c1646e19dc4735129402df5ed03062c643ef5514cf10dd187aa9"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s06-01",
          "text": "It is important to do so.",
          "emotion": "warm",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.762
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "warm",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s07": {
      "id": "s07",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s07.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s07.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 15.087,
      "files": {
        "v3-s07.opus": "76064321e7cf76c6cefce2fbf2bd89b22a88d69203cb0db11e943f735ce92800",
        "v3-s07.mp3": "94ab1ae8494e4cf41897eadacf291ca9674893f1b1f1fe73725df2624bd67d0d"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s07-01",
          "text": "It is generally recognized, however, that the introduction of the computer in the early 20th century, ",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.407
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-02",
          "text": "followed by the invention of the integrated circuit during the 1960s, radically changed the process, ",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 6.407,
          "end": 12.027
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-03",
          "text": "although its impact on the media was not immediately apparent.",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 12.027,
          "end": 15.087
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "serious",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s08": {
      "id": "s08",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s08.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s08.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 11.008,
      "files": {
        "v3-s08.opus": "c63a68986f1cca615dcf95d6958f597657f333c73004ad2895150a16afa9e738",
        "v3-s08.mp3": "2c7b126478b6aaab859453204a90d7f8dc6235c25d8e556e27d463244068e5cd"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s08-01",
          "text": "As time went by, computers became smaller and more powerful, ",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.966
        },
        {
          "id": "s08-02",
          "text": "and they became “personal” too, as well as institutional, ",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 3.966,
          "end": 7.833
        },
        {
          "id": "s08-03",
          "text": "with display becoming sharper and storage capacity increasing.",
          "emotion": "lively",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 7.833,
          "end": 11.008
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "lively",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s09": {
      "id": "s09",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s09.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s09.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.313,
      "files": {
        "v3-s09.opus": "2d3f3b7d4e49c3f52f96a55ba50ba1c6fc0d523cc6b04db1f71e01e9cbe8959d",
        "v3-s09.mp3": "27764b5fbb6e8f4a1e0499acc6e6e8e3ad690c35337bc45c931aabcb04cc7d5d"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s09-01",
          "text": "They were thought of, like people, in terms of generations, ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.255
        },
        {
          "id": "s09-02",
          "text": "with the distance between generations much smaller.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 3.255,
          "end": 6.313
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s10": {
      "id": "s10",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s10.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s10.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 8.364,
      "files": {
        "v3-s10.opus": "3e68be5671e59a0f73069d20cfc0e74bb4fe9ffce644df2f20c08c21d9e874b7",
        "v3-s10.mp3": "fc6bec1ae0f6bb585a6bddc7089cde08f7c911944f3d7cabf058fa8c08d7cb9a"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s10-01",
          "text": "It was within the computer age that the term “information society” began to be widely used ",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.936
        },
        {
          "id": "s10-02",
          "text": "to describe the context within which we now live.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 5.936,
          "end": 8.364
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s11": {
      "id": "s11",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s11.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s11.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 12.687,
      "files": {
        "v3-s11.opus": "5595b44c108a62ea0a1f814bb637d8d3a315ce36fe100a011da93e192d89eef3",
        "v3-s11.mp3": "fdcb9dcde225896292c6ac92346863ce3cc98993411b3643748b764a89cc8555"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s11-01",
          "text": "The communications revolution has influenced both work and leisure and how we think and feel both about place and time, ",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.991
        },
        {
          "id": "s11-02",
          "text": "but there have been controversial views about its economic, political, social and cultural implications.",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 6.991,
          "end": 12.687
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04",
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "serious",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s12": {
      "id": "s12",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s12.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s12.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 3.041,
      "files": {
        "v3-s12.opus": "48be5661c4e50b6e5908c32f050163a24156eab40269d307efb816964c13a82f",
        "v3-s12.mp3": "5e269fa810c61037770368b1a85033b4251a56626495f6c6df4cc238531cecaf"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s12-01",
          "text": "“Benefits” have been weighed against “harmful” outcomes.",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "intensity": 1,
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.041
        }
      ],
      "actor_id": "04",
      "actor_sequence": [
        "04"
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "intensity": 1,
      "c_mode_version": "v3-content-cast",
      "artificial_pause_ms": 0,
      "post_tempo": false,
      "qa_status": "candidate"
    },
    "s13": {
      "id": "s13",
      "path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s13.opus",
      "mp3_path": "./audio/2002/c-cloze/v3-s13.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 3.107,
      "files": {
        "v3-s13.opus": "a38f4086fbc2366a81a3b0f115ea8ff2404ae29ceb141153fa77b3cba516c084",
        "v3-s13.mp3": "ba06ccd70c643347296aea39f312a55a7abae8a33022d08defaa507b60dae5bd"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": "s13-01",
